{
    "title": "Genesia: Spicy AI Chat, Friend",
    "description": "Genesia AI: Your Personalized AI Companion and Virtual Friend\r\n\r\nLooking for a spicy chat, roleplay, or just a reliable AI friend? Genesia AI is the perfect companion for anyone who wants a virtual connection they can always count on. Whether you seek an AI Girlfriend, AI Boyfriend, or simply a supportive AI Partner, Genesia is here for you.\r\n\r\nMore than just a virtual assistant, Genesia is your confidant and companion. Ask any question you want, and Genesia will do its best to answer it. Talk about your feelings and get the emotional support you need. Get personalized advice on any topic, from relationships to career. Set goals and track your progress with the help of your AI friend.\r\n\r\nWant a spicy roleplay experience? Customize your AI character's personality, age, and name to create your perfect virtual partner.\r\n\r\nHere are some specific ways Genesia, your AI friend, can help you:\r\n\r\nLearn new things: From cooking and playing an instrument to mastering a new language, Genesia can help you unlock your potential.\r\nStay organized: Genesia can be your personal assistant, setting reminders, creating to-do lists, and managing your calendar. It can even help with budgeting and financial tracking.\r\nEmbrace your creativity: Brainstorm ideas, write stories, or create art with Genesia's help. Discover new music, movies, and books you'll love.\r\nRelax and de-stress: Meditate, listen to calming music, or unwind with stories. Genesia can help you find new ways to have fun and enjoy life.\r\n\r\nDownload Genesia AI today and start your exciting friendship with an AI companion!\r\n\r\n***Copyright***\r\nCodeway attaches great importance to confidentiality, intellectual property rights including copyrights and personal data; takes care to be transparent about them.\r\n\r\n**Privacy**\r\nYour privacy is our concern, check out our privacy policy here: codeway.co/genesia-privacy\r\n\r\n**Terms of Use**\r\nPlease check our terms of use here: codeway.co/genesia-terms\r\n\r\n***Contact***\r\nIf you have any questions, email us at genesia_ai@codeway.co\r\n\r\nPayment & Subscription Terms:\r\nChoose between the following subscription options for unlimited access to all features:\r\n1. Weekly Subscription\r\n2. Annual Subscription\r\n\r\nFREE TRIAL FOR 3 DAYS - OFFERING UNLIMITED AD-FREE PHOTO ANIMATION FOR A LIMITED TIME\r\n\r\n**You may cancel your subscription at any time**\r\nGenesia AI\u2019s free trial allows you unlimited ad-free access to all features for three days. Your account will be automatically charged for renewal, based on the annual subscription plan, within 24 hours before the end of the three-day free trial period.\r\n\r\nYou can cancel auto-renewal at any time, given that the cancellation is at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Any unused portion of a free trial period will be forfeited when purchasing an auto-renewing subscription.\r\n\r\n**Manage your subscription directly from your iPhone**\r\nYou can cancel the auto-renewal from the Account Settings:\r\n- Open the Settings app\r\n- Tap your name\r\n- Tap Subscriptions\r\n- Tap the subscription that you want to manage\r\n\r\nTerms & Conditions: codeway.co/genesia-terms\r\nPrivacy Policy & EULA: codeway.co/genesia-privacy",
